@startuml
title Create Assistant Account

actor Client
participant "Express Router" as Router
participant authRequired as Auth
participant "roleRequired(ADMIN_CLINIC)" as Role
participant "AdminClinicController\n(createAccountAssistant)" as Ctrl
participant "AdminClinicService\n(getClinicByAdmin)" as AdminSvc
participant "AssistantService\n(createAssistant)" as AsstSvc
database "MongoDB" as DB

Client -> Router: POST /create_assistant { body }
Router -> Auth: verify auth
Auth --> Router: OK
Router -> Role: ensure role ADMIN_CLINIC
Role --> Router: OK
Router -> Ctrl: createAccountAssistant(req, res)

' Resolve clinic of this admin
Ctrl -> Ctrl: accountId = req.user.sub
Ctrl -> AdminSvc: getClinicByAdmin(accountId)
AdminSvc -> DB: User.findOne(account_id)\n-> AdminClinic.findOne(user_id)\n-> Clinic.findOne(created_by)\n(populate specialties)
DB --> AdminSvc: clinic
AdminSvc --> Ctrl: { ok: true, data: clinic }

' Normalize input
Ctrl -> Ctrl: type = unique(roles ∪ type)\npayload = {...req.body, clinic_id: clinic._id, type}

' Create assistant (transaction)
Ctrl -> AsstSvc: createAssistant(payload)
note right of AsstSvc
  Start transaction
  - hash password
  - Account.create({ role: ASSISTANT, ACTIVE, email_verified: true })
  - User.create({ account_id })
  - Assistant.create({ user_id, clinic_id, doctor_id, type })
  Commit
end note
AsstSvc -> DB: Account.create / User.create / Assistant.create
DB --> AsstSvc: created docs
AsstSvc --> Ctrl: { ok: true, data:{ account, user, assistant } }

Ctrl --> Client: 200 JSON { ok: true, message: "Created", data }

@enduml
